<!-- chapter: The Weighing -->
# The Weighing

<!-- page: A-1 -->

Each sack was weighed twice before it left the yard\.

The foreman wrote the figure <!-- page: 3 -->on a slate and wiped it clean again\.

<!-- chapter: The Count -->
# The Count

<!-- page: 4 -->

At dusk the tally was read out loud\, sack by sack\.